<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts San Paulo.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts San Paulo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston started Italian banking group Instituto Bancario San Paulo di Torino as a &quot;buy,&quot; the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Analysts at CSFB said the bank was a low-profile but significantly cheaper way to play Italian bank restructuring and set a price target of 16,000 lire on the stock.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
